                                "sense_id": "cd523145-1d77-3e57-97e8-de5dc95daa66",
                                "text": "While Ulbricht technically remained in office as Chairman of the State Council, a position that ostensibly gave him a role as elder statesman, he was sidelined by Honecker with systematic ruthlessness."
